  "instructions": [
    "Combine chicken breast and score in a blender or food processor and blend until smooth.",
    "Heat chicken broth and water in a large pot over high heat until boiling.",
    "Add blended chicken mixture to the pot and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to medium and add green onion, ginger, garlic, gochujang, fish sauce, toasted sesame oil, doenjang, and salt to the pot.",
    "Stir to combine and cook for 10 minutes.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning as needed.",
